    "note": "Harvey Book pp.134-135 states Samuel Pringle married Martha, eldest daughter of Thomas and Keturah Lamoreux, in 1790; Thomas's will names 'Martha Pringle'; Harvey Book pp.370-371 makes James his son. His own parentage is only possible."
